{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Hunters Guild!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not the hero slaying dragons, you just decide who's foolish enough to try! While the guild's reputation is in shambles, every hunt you approve could rebuild its glory... or bury it further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hunter's Seal</i></strong>\u00a0is a medieval fantasy job simulator where your observational skills and keen memory will be put to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Approve and Reject Hunts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/extras/2fc98c6f832de1b8133432b97d5cffcd.poster.avif?t=1773162308\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/extras/2fc98c6f832de1b8133432b97d5cffcd.webm?t=1773162308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/extras/2fc98c6f832de1b8133432b97d5cffcd.mp4?t=1773162308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to identify the monster being described in a request and determine if a hunter is capable of slaying it based on their skill, weapon, and personality. Every quest demands something different, and the things to look out for grows everyday.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not So Unique Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identifying monsters won't be easy. Even though every creature is unique, many share similar traits that could be confused for one another. Did a dragon's fire really burn the forest or was it acid from a giant slime?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunters of All Shapes and Sizes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/extras/0eb58af5e55fef47910895802cbc3ead.poster.avif?t=1773162308\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/extras/0eb58af5e55fef47910895802cbc3ead.webm?t=1773162308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/extras/0eb58af5e55fef47910895802cbc3ead.mp4?t=1773162308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hunters are just as varied with their own quirks, ambitions, and questionable sense of preparedness. Some hunt monsters for glory, others to protect their family, but a few will insist that they should never be hunted at all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices Matter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everyone wants you to do a good job. There is a group that believes killing monsters is wrong and that you are interfering with the natural order. Some will try to bribe, charm, or even threaten their way past you. Will you play it safe and just do your job, or will you gamble with the guild\u2019s future and live with the consequences?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3955230/2e08c65191c491e7256facbb3976fd0da8bb7f00.jpg"},{"name":"Dog Lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3955230/a7c78272261404dd19af8204ad382b818ed19164.jpg"},{"name":"Work Hazard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3955230/ee4a791e535ed1edaa12746729489e677c58705f.jpg"},{"name":"Pro Stamper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3955230/e598102dbc7eed8149a1e308887d4a9773192603.jpg"},{"name":"Not too bad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3955230/c974b4160fb2993bcab813953e4b9524ad26a240.jpg"},{"name":"Let it Burn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3955230/cfcb5a22874aac6b3e11fa043aa0876472252c26.jpg"},{"name":"Don't Starve","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3955230/392d6e6bdeb83e9c285aa729f63fa4cbefdc0bb4.jpg"},{"name":"Too Much Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3955230/737ddbef7687b47a92389a68feb3fdea67b546b6.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3955230/aaf072365372f063ae43c6f04d0f4da42166f88f.jpg"},{"name":"The Ramsey Treatment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3955230/a53e5cdbcf2279b951e5008763a26cb6f5ff838e.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955230?t=1773162308","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955230?t=1773162308","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/b30a4924db76a0a8699f16a74579055afdabec76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773162308","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/b30a4924db76a0a8699f16a74579055afdabec76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773162308","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Hunters Guild!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not the hero slaying dragons, you just decide who's foolish enough to try! While the guild's reputation is in shambles, every hunt you approve could rebuild its glory... or bury it further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hunter's Seal</i></strong>\u00a0is a medieval fantasy job simulator where your observational skills and keen memory will be put to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Approve and Reject Hunts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/extras/2fc98c6f832de1b8133432b97d5cffcd.poster.avif?t=1773162308\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/extras/2fc98c6f832de1b8133432b97d5cffcd.webm?t=1773162308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/extras/2fc98c6f832de1b8133432b97d5cffcd.mp4?t=1773162308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to identify the monster being described in a request and determine if a hunter is capable of slaying it based on their skill, weapon, and personality. Every quest demands something different, and the things to look out for grows everyday.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not So Unique Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identifying monsters won't be easy. Even though every creature is unique, many share similar traits that could be confused for one another. Did a dragon's fire really burn the forest or was it acid from a giant slime?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunters of All Shapes and Sizes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/extras/0eb58af5e55fef47910895802cbc3ead.poster.avif?t=1773162308\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955230/extras/0eb58af5e55fef47910895802cbc3ead.webm?t=1773162308\